# This directory contains pre-built WASM binaries for integration testing.
# WASM files (.wasm) in this directory SHOULD be checked into git.
# 
# To add a test WASM:
# 1. Build your .wasm file
# 2. Copy it here
# 3. Git add it explicitly: git add test_wasms/your_test.wasm
# 4. Add corresponding tests in hogd/hogexec/runtime/
